Third-party data

Arena (https://arena.ai)
  ia_router/data/arena.json contains a reduced and reorganized copy of Arena's public leaderboards
  (dataset "leaderboard-dataset"), published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 license (CC BY 4.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes made: only the categories the router uses are kept,
  and only the fields model, rating, confidence interval, votes and price, in a compact format.

Artificial Analysis (https://artificialanalysis.ai/)
  Its data is queried through its API with each user's free key; it is not redistributed with this software.
  Its attribution is shown every time it is used.
